  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution towards ALNAP&apos;s activites for 2025. ALNAP is a network of NGOs, donors, academics, and constultants, hosted by ODI, which aims to tackle inequitable access to humanitarian learning and knowledge sharing, the inability to utilise existing learning to affect change, and to fill crucial gaps in sector-wide evidence and analysis needed to support more informed and effectove humanitarian policy and practice. ALNAP has a vision of the humanitarian system that can deliver protection and principled assistance to the most vulnerable crisis-affected people. ALNAP leads a systematic process of continous learning through evidence-based research and sharing of lessons across the ALNAP network.</narrative>
  </description>
